<h2 data-start=3D"62" data-end=3D"121" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"65"=
 data-end=3D"119">1. Qu=E2=80=99est-ce que la Programmation Orient=C3=A9e O=
bjet ?</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"123" data-end=3D"428" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=3D"=
126" data-end=3D"164">Programmation Orient=C3=A9e Objet (POO)</strong> est =
un paradigme de programmation qui repose sur la mod=C3=A9lisation du monde =
r=C3=A9el =C3=A0 travers des <strong data-start=3D"258" data-end=3D"268">ob=
jets</strong>. Ces objets sont des entit=C3=A9s regroupant =C3=A0 la fois d=
es <strong data-start=3D"323" data-end=3D"334">donn=C3=A9es</strong> (appel=
=C3=A9es <strong data-start=3D"345" data-end=3D"358">attributs</strong> ou =
<strong data-start=3D"362" data-end=3D"376">propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</strong>) =
et des <strong data-start=3D"385" data-end=3D"402">comportements</strong> (=
appel=C3=A9s <strong data-start=3D"412" data-end=3D"424">m=C3=A9thodes</str=
ong>).</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"430" data-end=3D"465" class=3D"">=F0=9F=94=B9 <strong dat=
a-start=3D"437" data-end=3D"463">Principes Fondamentaux</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"467" data-end=3D"514" class=3D"">La POO repose sur <strong=
 data-start=3D"485" data-end=3D"510">quatre principes cl=C3=A9s</strong> :<=
/p>
<ol data-start=3D"516" data-end=3D"884">
<li data-start=3D"516" data-end=3D"594" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"519" data-end=3D"594" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"519=
" data-end=3D"536">Encapsulation</strong> : Protection des donn=C3=A9es en =
limitant leur acc=C3=A8s direct.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"595" data-end=3D"698" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"598" data-end=3D"698" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"598=
" data-end=3D"610">H=C3=A9ritage</strong> : Capacit=C3=A9 d=E2=80=99une cla=
sse =C3=A0 h=C3=A9riter des propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s et comportements d=E2=80=
=99une autre classe.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"699" data-end=3D"801" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"702" data-end=3D"801" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"702=
" data-end=3D"719">Polymorphisme</strong> : Capacit=C3=A9 d=E2=80=99un obje=
t =C3=A0 =C3=AAtre trait=C3=A9 comme un autre objet de la m=C3=AAme hi=C3=
=A9rarchie.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"802" data-end=3D"884" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"805" data-end=3D"884" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"805=
" data-end=3D"820">Abstraction</strong> : Simplification d=E2=80=99un objet=
 en cachant les d=C3=A9tails complexes.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"886" data-end=3D"1033" class=3D"">La POO est utilis=C3=A9e=
 dans des langages comme <strong data-start=3D"930" data-end=3D"1013">Java,=
 C++, Python, PHP, C#, JavaScript (ES6+ avec classes), Swift, Ruby, Kotlin<=
/strong> et bien d=E2=80=99autres.</p>
