<h3 data-start=3D"6913" data-end=3D"6966" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6917" data-end=3D"6966">5.1 Bonnes Pratiques pour les Constructeurs :</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6968" data-end=3D"7307">
<li data-start=3D"6968" data-end=3D"7131" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6970" data-end=3D"7131" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
970" data-end=3D"7016">Initialiser tous les attributs n=C3=A9cessaires</str=
