<p data-start=3D"4279" data-end=3D"4299" class=3D"">=F0=9F=94=B9 <strong da=
ta-start=3D"4282" data-end=3D"4299">Explication :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"4300" data-end=3D"4547">
<li data-start=3D"4300" data-end=3D"4422" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4302" data-end=3D"4422" class=3D"">Les attributs <code dat=
a-start=3D"4316" data-end=3D"4323">__nom</code> et <code data-start=3D"4327=
" data-end=3D"4334">__age</code> sont priv=C3=A9s, ce qui les rend inaccess=
ibles directement depuis l'ext=C3=A9rieur de la classe.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4423" data-end=3D"4547" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4425" data-end=3D"4547" class=3D"">Pour acc=C3=A9der ou mo=
difier ces attributs, il est n=C3=A9cessaire de passer par des <strong data=
-start=3D"4501" data-end=3D"4523">m=C3=A9thodes publiques</strong> (comme <=
code data-start=3D"4531" data-end=3D"4545">afficher_nom</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4549" data-end=3D"4608" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4553" data-end=3D"4608">3.2 Avantages et Inconv=C3=A9nients des Attributs P=
riv=C3=A9s</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4610" data-end=3D"5105">
<li data-start=3D"4610" data-end=3D"4869" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4612" data-end=3D"4627" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
612" data-end=3D"4625">Avantages</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4630" data-end=3D"4869">
<li data-start=3D"4630" data-end=3D"4748" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4632" data-end=3D"4748" class=3D"">L'encapsulation est ren=
forc=C3=A9e : les donn=C3=A9es de l'objet ne peuvent pas =C3=AAtre modifi=
=C3=A9es directement depuis l'ext=C3=A9rieur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4751" data-end=3D"4869" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4753" data-end=3D"4869" class=3D"">Contr=C3=B4le plus fin =
sur la gestion de l'=C3=A9tat de l'objet (par exemple, validation des donn=
=C3=A9es avant leur modification).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4871" data-end=3D"5105" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4873" data-end=3D"4892" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
873" data-end=3D"4890">Inconv=C3=A9nients</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4895" data-end=3D"5105">
<li data-start=3D"4895" data-end=3D"4982" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4897" data-end=3D"4982" class=3D"">Moins flexible : vous n=
e pouvez pas acc=C3=A9der directement aux attributs de l'ext=C3=A9rieur.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4985" data-end=3D"5105" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4987" data-end=3D"5105" class=3D"">Si vous avez besoin d'u=
n acc=C3=A8s direct, vous devez d=C3=A9finir des m=C3=A9thodes publiques ou=
 des <strong data-start=3D"5075" data-end=3D"5089">propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s</st=
rong> pour y acc=C3=A9der.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5107" data-end=3D"5156" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5111" data-end=3D"5156">3.3 Quand Utiliser les Attributs Priv=C3=A9s ?</str=
ong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5157" data-end=3D"5381" class=3D"">Les attributs priv=C3=
=A9s doivent =C3=AAtre utilis=C3=A9s lorsque vous souhaitez garantir que le=
s donn=C3=A9es sensibles de l'objet ne soient pas modifi=C3=A9es directemen=
t, assurant ainsi une meilleure s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 et un contr=C3=B4le sur =
leur modification.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5383" data-end=3D"5386" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5388" data-end=3D"5416" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5391" data-end=3D"5416">4. Attributs Prot=C3=A9g=C3=A9s</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5418" data-end=3D"5463" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5422" data-end=3D"5463">4.1 D=C3=A9finition des Attributs Prot=C3=A9g=C3=A9=
s</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5465" data-end=3D"5779" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"5469" data-end=3D"5491">attributs prot=C3=A9g=C3=A9s</strong> sont des =
attributs qui ne doivent normalement pas =C3=AAtre modifi=C3=A9s ou accessi=
