</li>
<li data-start=3D"6900" data-end=3D"6997" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6902" data-end=3D"6997" class=3D"">Favorise l'encapsulatio=
n tout en permettant une certaine <strong data-start=3D"6959" data-end=3D"6=
