<ul data-start=3D"7025" data-end=3D"7230">
<li data-start=3D"7025" data-end=3D"7151" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7027" data-end=3D"7151" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s di=
rect aux attributs prot=C3=A9g=C3=A9s depuis l=E2=80=99ext=C3=A9rieur n=E2=
=80=99est <strong data-start=3D"7090" data-end=3D"7108">pas recommand=C3=A9=
</strong> et peut nuire =C3=A0 la stabilit=C3=A9 du programme.</p>
