<li data-start=3D"7978" data-end=3D"8092" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7980" data-end=3D"8092" class=3D"">Utilisez des attributs =
priv=C3=A9s pour prot=C3=A9ger les donn=C3=A9es de l'objet et emp=C3=AAcher=
 les modifications non contr=C3=B4l=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8093" data-end=3D"8208" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8095" data-end=3D"8208" class=3D"">D=C3=A9finissez des <st=
rong data-start=3D"8110" data-end=3D"8132">m=C3=A9thodes publiques</strong>=
 ou des <strong data-start=3D"8140" data-end=3D"8154">propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s<=
/strong> pour interagir avec ces donn=C3=A9es de mani=C3=A8re contr=C3=B4l=
=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"8210" data-end=3D"8260" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
