<p data-start=3D"8120" data-end=3D"8157" class=3D"">=F0=9F=8E=AF <strong da=
ta-start=3D"8123" data-end=3D"8155">R=C3=A9sum=C3=A9 des points essentiels<=
/strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8158" data-end=3D"8777">
<li data-start=3D"8158" data-end=3D"8320" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8160" data-end=3D"8320" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
