<li data-start=3D"7501" data-end=3D"7727" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7503" data-end=3D"7727" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"7507" data-end=3D"7524">constructeurs</strong> des classes parente ne s=
