<li data-start=3D"1733" data-end=3D"1769" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1735" data-end=3D"1769" class=3D"">Un nombre diff=C3=A9ren=
t de param=C3=A8tres.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1770" data-end=3D"1807" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1772" data-end=3D"1807" class=3D"">Des types de param=C3=
=A8tres diff=C3=A9rents.</p>
</li>
</ul>
