<p data-start=3D"6534" data-end=3D"6580" class=3D"">=F0=9F=94=B9 <strong da=
ta-start=3D"6537" data-end=3D"6578">Pourquoi utiliser une interface ici ?</=
strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"6581" data-end=3D"6818">
<li data-start=3D"6581" data-end=3D"6643" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6583" data-end=3D"6643" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"658=
3" data-end=3D"6593">Vehicule</code> d=C3=A9finit <strong data-start=3D"660=
2" data-end=3D"6616">un contrat</strong> pour tous les v=C3=A9hicules.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6644" data-end=3D"6716" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6646" data-end=3D"6716" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"664=
6" data-end=3D"6655">Voiture</code> et <code data-start=3D"6659" data-end=
=3D"6665">Moto</code> doivent impl=C3=A9menter <code data-start=3D"6686" da=
ta-end=3D"6698">demarrer()</code> et <code data-start=3D"6702" data-end=3D"=
6713">arreter()</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6717" data-end=3D"6818" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6719" data-end=3D"6818" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
719" data-end=3D"6795">On peut ajouter de nouveaux types de v=C3=A9hicules =
sans modifier l=E2=80=99interface</strong> =E2=86=92 <strong data-start=3D"=
6798" data-end=3D"6815">Code =C3=A9volutif</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
