<hr data-start=3D"5104" data-end=3D"5107" class=3D"" style=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5109" data-end=3D"5161" class=3D"">7. Bonnes pratiques av=
ec les classes abstraites</h2>
<p data-start=3D"5163" data-end=3D"5208" class=3D"">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-=
start=3D"5165" data-end=3D"5198">Utilisez une classe abstraite</strong> qua=
nd :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5209" data-end=3D"5351">
<li data-start=3D"5209" data-end=3D"5281" class=3D"" style=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5211" data-end=3D"5281" class=3D"">Il y a <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"5218" data-end=3D"5247">des comportements communs</strong> (m=C3=A9th=
odes concr=C3=A8tes partag=C3=A9es).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5282" data-end=3D"5351" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5284" data-end=3D"5351" class=3D"">Vous voulez <strong dat=
a-start=3D"5296" data-end=3D"5325">forcer certaines m=C3=A9thodes</strong> =
dans les classes enfants.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"5353" data-end=3D"5454" class=3D"">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-=
start=3D"5355" data-end=3D"5376">Nommez clairement</strong> vos classes pou=
r indiquer leur nature abstraite (<code data-start=3D"5426" data-end=3D"543=
2">Base</code>, <code data-start=3D"5434" data-end=3D"5444">Abstract</code>=
, etc.).</p>
<p data-start=3D"5456" data-end=3D"5573" class=3D"">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-=
start=3D"5458" data-end=3D"5492">=C3=89vitez l'instanciation directe</stron=
g> par erreur en documentant ou en utilisant des outils de v=C3=A9rificatio=
n statique.</p>
<p data-start=3D"5575" data-end=3D"5706" class=3D"">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-=
start=3D"5577" data-end=3D"5602">Minimisez le couplage</strong> : laissez l=
a possibilit=C3=A9 =C3=A0 vos sous-classes de sp=C3=A9cialiser sans =C3=AAt=
re pi=C3=A9g=C3=A9es par une hi=C3=A9rarchie rigide.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5708" data-end=3D"5711" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5713" data-end=3D"5740" class=3D"">8. Cas pratiques avanc=
=C3=A9s</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"5742" data-end=3D"6113">
<li data-start=3D"5742" data-end=3D"5862" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5744" data-end=3D"5862" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
744" data-end=3D"5758">Frameworks</strong> : En Django (Python), les <code =
data-start=3D"5785" data-end=3D"5803">AbstractBaseUser</code>, <code data-s=
tart=3D"5805" data-end=3D"5820">AbstractModel</code> sont des exemples d'ut=
ilisation r=C3=A9elle.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5863" data-end=3D"5958" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5865" data-end=3D"5958" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
865" data-end=3D"5890">Patrons de conception</strong> : Le <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"5896" data-end=3D"5923">Template Method Pattern</strong> repose sur l=
es classes abstraites.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5959" data-end=3D"6113" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5961" data-end=3D"6113" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
961" data-end=3D"5984">D=C3=A9veloppement d=E2=80=99API</strong> : L'archit=
ecture orient=C3=A9e service (SOA) utilise souvent des abstractions pour s=
=C3=A9parer la couche m=C3=A9tier de l'interface technique.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6115" data-end=3D"6118" class=3D"">
<h1 data-start=3D"6120" data-end=3D"6137" class=3D"">=F0=9F=93=8C Conclusio=
n</h1>
<p data-start=3D"6139" data-end=3D"6244" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=
=3D"6142" data-end=3D"6162">classe abstraite</strong> est <strong data-star=
t=3D"6167" data-end=3D"6192">un pilier fondamental</strong> de l=E2=80=99ar=
chitecture orient=C3=A9e objet.<br data-start=3D"6226" data-end=3D"6229">
Elle sert =C3=A0 :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6245" data-end=3D"6445">
<li data-start=3D"6245" data-end=3D"6291" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6247" data-end=3D"6291" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
247" data-end=3D"6261">Normaliser</strong> les comportements attendus.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6292" data-end=3D"6331" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6294" data-end=3D"6331" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
294" data-end=3D"6320">R=C3=A9duire la duplication</strong> de code.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6332" data-end=3D"6368" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6334" data-end=3D"6368" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
334" data-end=3D"6365">Simplifier le polymorphisme</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6369" data-end=3D"6445" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6371" data-end=3D"6445" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
371" data-end=3D"6398">Am=C3=A9liorer la lisibilit=C3=A9</strong> et <stron=
g data-start=3D"6402" data-end=3D"6423">la maintenabilit=C3=A9</strong> des=
 grands projets.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6447" data-end=3D"6582" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
447" data-end=3D"6464">Bien utilis=C3=A9e</strong>, elle devient un <strong=
 data-start=3D"6482" data-end=3D"6503">outil strat=C3=A9gique</strong> pour=
 construire des syst=C3=A8mes <strong data-start=3D"6533" data-end=3D"6547"=
>modulaires</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"6549" data-end=3D"6562">=C3=A9v=
olutifs</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"6566" data-end=3D"6578">robustes<=
/strong>. =F0=9F=9A=80</p>
