carte bancaire, PayPal, crypto) est interchangeable.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5829" data-end=3D"5832" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"5834" data-end=3D"5859" class=3D"">8.2. Observer Pattern<=
/h3>
<blockquote data-start=3D"5861" data-end=3D"5955">
<p data-start=3D"5863" data-end=3D"5955" class=3D"">Un sujet notifie automa=
tiquement ses observateurs, tous reli=C3=A9s via une interface <code data-s=
tart=3D"5944" data-end=3D"5954">Observer</code>.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"5957" data-end=3D"5960" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"5962" data-end=3D"5986" class=3D"">8.3. Adapter Pattern</=
h3>
<blockquote data-start=3D"5988" data-end=3D"6111">
<p data-start=3D"5990" data-end=3D"6111" class=3D"">Convertit une interface=
 existante pour correspondre =C3=A0 une autre interface requise, <strong da=
ta-start=3D"6073" data-end=3D"6090">sans modifier</strong> la classe origin=
ale.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start=3D"6113" data-end=3D"6116" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6118" data-end=3D"6160" class=3D"">9. Bonnes Pratiques av=
ec les Interfaces</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6162" data-end=3D"6521">
<li data-start=3D"6162" data-end=3D"6240" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6164" data-end=3D"6240" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
164" data-end=3D"6184">Nomme clairement</strong> tes interfaces (<code data=
-start=3D"6201" data-end=3D"6212">IPaiement</code>, <code data-start=3D"621=
4" data-end=3D"6224">IService</code>, <code data-start=3D"6226" data-end=3D=
"6232">IDao</code>, etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6241" data-end=3D"6348" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6243" data-end=3D"6348" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
243" data-end=3D"6288">=C3=89vite de m=C3=A9langer comportement et contrat<=
/strong> : une interface ne doit <strong data-start=3D"6313" data-end=3D"63=
20">pas</strong> contenir de logique m=C3=A9tier.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6349" data-end=3D"6434" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6351" data-end=3D"6434" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
351" data-end=3D"6391">Pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9rer l=E2=80=99interface au type concr=
et</strong> pour les param=C3=A8tres, variables, et champs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6435" data-end=3D"6521" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6437" data-end=3D"6521" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
437" data-end=3D"6484">Privil=C3=A9gie une interface par responsabilit=C3=
=A9</strong> (<code data-start=3D"6486" data-end=3D"6519">Single Responsibi=
lity Principle</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6523" data-end=3D"6526" class=3D"">
<h1 data-start=3D"6528" data-end=3D"6543" class=3D"">=F0=9F=93=8C Conclusio=
n</h1>
<p data-start=3D"6545" data-end=3D"6677" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"6549" data-end=3D"6563">interfaces</strong> sont <strong data-start=3D"=
6569" data-end=3D"6586">fondamentales</strong> pour construire des applicat=
ions <strong data-start=3D"6620" data-end=3D"6655">souples, =C3=A9volutives=
 et robustes</strong>.<br data-start=3D"6656" data-end=3D"6659">
Elles permettent :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6678" data-end=3D"6834">
<li data-start=3D"6678" data-end=3D"6716" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6680" data-end=3D"6716" class=3D"">De <strong data-start=
=3D"6683" data-end=3D"6715">d=C3=A9finir des contrats stricts</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6717" data-end=3D"6784" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6719" data-end=3D"6784" class=3D"">D'<strong data-start=3D=
"6721" data-end=3D"6751">assurer l'interop=C3=A9rabilit=C3=A9</strong> entr=
e des composants disparates.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6785" data-end=3D"6834" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6787" data-end=3D"6834" class=3D"">D'<strong data-start=3D=
"6789" data-end=3D"6833">am=C3=A9liorer le respect des principes SOLID</str=
ong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6836" data-end=3D"6955" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
836" data-end=3D"6869">Bien ma=C3=AEtriser les interfaces</strong>, c=E2=80=
=99est <strong data-start=3D"6877" data-end=3D"6951">concevoir du code plus=
 clair, plus propre, et mieux pr=C3=AAt pour l=E2=80=99avenir</strong>. =F0=
=9F=9A=80</p>
